 update doesn't add new story content — it focuses on improving how the Demo plays and looks.Story PresentationAll static CGs in the story have been replaced with animated CGs, so key moments are no longer a single frozen frame.The static CGs are still fully available in the Gallery for anyone who prefers the original compositions.GameplayAdded 3 skill check minigames — certain story decisions now call for hands-on play.Each minigame comes with a tutorial that walks you through ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T03:36:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183781308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4337080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4337080":"2026-10-26T12:07:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4337080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:54Z"},"4337120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:55Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4337080","app_id":4337080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f50ad21c91b75194c2a544c3310caecc790f8d02b6bf6393a7baf8546b6dd71e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Draconite is a Furry-themed side-scrolling adventure game focused on exploration and storytelling.